  "en": {
    "id": 5012030,
    "name": "Aggressive Reading Material",
    "desc": "As the saying goes, \"Buying books is like a landslide; reading them is like spinning silk.\" Bibliophiles are always buying new volumes yet rarely crack them open.\\nThe guilt of having \"so much unread\" and the self-deception that \"I'll get to it someday\" have woven together to create a vicious imagenae known as \"Aggressive Reading Material.\"",
